
## Ansible - Handler to Restart Nginx
---
- name:Manage Nginx
-hosts: all
become:yes
tasks:
-name: Update config file
copy:
src:Index.html
dest: user/share /nginx/html/index.html
notify: Restart Nginx
handlers:
- name: Restart Nginx
service:
name: nginx
state: Restart
